From: Ubuntu Desktop bug work
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: display/wacom/network: guard NULL GError, devices, and NM settings

Display panel init logged error->message when the finish function
left error NULL. Wacom mock-stylus idle and display combo used empty
or stale models. QR/Wi-Fi rows assumed connection settings exist.

Forwarded: no
---
--- a/panels/display/cc-display-panel.c	2026-08-14 09:06:39.000000000 +0000
+++ b/panels/display/cc-display-panel.c	2026-08-14 09:06:20.283866765 +0000
@@ -1038,7 +1038,8 @@
   proxy = cc_object_storage_create_dbus_proxy_finish (res, &error);
   if (!proxy)
     {
-      if (!g_error_matches (error, G_IO_ERROR, G_IO_ERROR_CANCELLED))
+      if (error &&
+          !g_error_matches (error, G_IO_ERROR, G_IO_ERROR_CANCELLED))
         g_warning ("Failed to contact gnome-shell: %s", error->message);
       return;
     }
@@ -1059,7 +1060,8 @@
   bus = g_bus_get_finish (res, &error);
   if (!bus)
     {
-      if (!g_error_matches (error, G_IO_ERROR, G_IO_ERROR_CANCELLED))
+      if (error &&
+          !g_error_matches (error, G_IO_ERROR, G_IO_ERROR_CANCELLED))
         {
           g_warning ("Failed to get session bus: %s", error->message);
         }
